<p>Hello {{ user.first_name }},</p>
<p>Someone asked to reset the password for {{ user.email }}. If that was you, use the button below. Otherwise you can ignore this message.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0;"><a href="{{ reset_url }}" style="background:#16140f;color:#f3efe6;padding:12px 20px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;">Choose a new password</a></p>
